          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abneri ki jone gucako wot i dyewor meno guwoto dyewor benebene, kun giwok ki i Araba, ka guŋolo kwede kulu Jordan, guwoto nakanaka cakke odiko nio wa dyeceŋ guo kwede i Makanaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joab oweko lubo kor Abneri, odok woko cen. Ka ocoko lwak ogurogi kacel, ci ginoŋo lutic pa Daudi ma doŋ wangi orwenyo woko giromo apar wiye aŋwen, kacel ki Acael bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lutic pa Daudi onoŋo guneko jo Benjamin ma gin aye lwak pa Abneri ma romo dano miya adek ki pyerabicel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joab ki jone gutiŋo kom Acael, guyiko i lyel pa wonne ma onoŋo tye i Beterekem, Ka gudwogo ki kunnu, guwoto dyewor benebene, nio ka piny oru botgi wa i Kebron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
